  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haiti Joint Office -  Civil Society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this programme is to build environmentally, socially, and economically sustainable and resilient communities that are strengthened to withstand emergencies, are economically empowered, have access to improved water and sanitation services, and prevent the spread of water-borne disease through good hygiene practices. The support and strengthening of civil society actors will drive the achievement of the objective.</narrative>
  </description>
